WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.114
- It's a video of a beluga whale

00:00:02.114 --> 00:00:04.007
and these kids at an aquarium.

00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:08.811
(upbeat brass instruments)

00:00:08.811 --> 00:00:11.412
- My mom almost
exclusively shares pictures

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:13.684
of dogs and cats that need adoption.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:15.713
- Children hearing a favorite song

00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:16.804
and dancing mid football.

00:00:16.804 --> 00:00:18.214
- Fresh Pug of Bel Air.

00:00:18.214 --> 00:00:20.397
- Chicken soup recipe,
and then we've got a dog.

00:00:20.397 --> 00:00:21.453
- Book awards.

00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:23.555
Who doesn't love book awards?

00:00:23.555 --> 00:00:25.354
- It's a kitty cat that needs a home.

00:00:25.354 --> 00:00:27.536
And a dog that needs a home.

00:00:27.536 --> 00:00:29.606
And there's a cat that needs a home.

00:00:29.606 --> 00:00:31.251
This is exactly my mom.

00:00:31.251 --> 00:00:32.935
My mom has cared more about her animals

00:00:32.935 --> 00:00:35.315
than her children for as
long as I can remember.

00:00:35.315 --> 00:00:38.913
- A very rare video of Helen
Keller with Andy Sullivan.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:42.422
(laughs) Mom.

00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:45.344
- That squirrel got its head
stuck in a Halloween decoration

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:46.943
and terrified the neighborhood.

00:00:46.943 --> 00:00:48.256
That is terrifying.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:51.022
- My mom's digital presence
is basically her in real life,

00:00:51.022 --> 00:00:54.004
but just the most effusive, sentimental,

00:00:54.004 --> 00:00:55.479
extreme version of it.

00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:57.778
- She literally shares
something every hour,

00:00:57.778 --> 00:01:00.541
and tags me every time.

00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:03.199
In everything she shares.

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:08.337
(upbeat brass instruments)

